# Annex I 2(c)/2(f): signed sysupgrade with the root key and the rollback floor in TROPIC01. See README.md.
# NOT selected by default yet: with it, an image that is not signed under a root key held in the chip is refused, and no
# unit has a root key or an initialised counter until it is provisioned. Enable it for a provisioned unit.
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_tropic01-secure-update=y
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_ucert=y
